# =============================================================================
# Portal  : https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# Free tier: 15 req/min, 1M tokens/day on gemini-2.0-flash (as of 2026)
#
# IMPORTANT: Free tier models change frequently (deprecation, quota cuts).
# GEMINI_FALLBACK_MODELS provides automatic fallback within Gemini.
# Always keep gemini-1.5-flash as the last entry — it is the most stable.
